OL,3,ATories aim to be election-ready ahead
OL,4,Aof party conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Kemi Badenoch arrived for her
OL,7,Ffirst Conservative conference as leader
OL,8,Flast year, a member of her entourage
OL,9,Foverheard somebody wonder aloud: "Who's
OL,10,Fthat?"
OL,12,FThis baffled member of the public was
OL,13,Factually working at the Conservative
OL,14,Fconference. Badenoch had been the
OL,15,Fparty's leader and the leader of the
OL,16,Fopposition for almost a year.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
