OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATories aim to be election-ready ahead
OL,4,Aof party conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is an anecdote which underlines the
OL,7,Fscale of the challenge Badenoch faced
OL,8,Fat that conference, an event her allies
OL,9,Fare now with distance willing to
OL,10,Facknowledge was make or break for her
OL,11,Fleadership.
OL,13,FAnd it is an anecdote which also
OL,14,Funderlines that, far from break her,
OL,15,Fthat conference represented the start
OL,16,Fof a major turnaround for Badenoch.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
